{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Use this prompt directly with **Shopify AI (Horizon Theme)** to generate a custom Hero section. It is written to give Horizon enough detail to closely match the UI while keeping everything editable from the Theme Editor.
    
    ---
    
    # Shopify Horizon AI Prompt – Premium Video Hero with Floating Glass Icons
    
    Create a premium, full-width Hero Banner section for the Horizon Shopify theme. The design should feel modern, premium, futuristic, and conversion-focused, similar to a high-end Shopify agency website.
    
    ## Layout
    
    * Full viewport width.
    * Desktop height: 700–780px.
    * Tablet: around 620px.
    * Mobile: auto height with generous spacing.
    * Content centered both vertically and horizontally.
    * Maximum content width around 720px.
    * Everything should remain perfectly centered on all screen sizes.
    
    ---
    
    ## Background
    
    The background must support a video.
    
    I will upload my own MP4 video.
    
    Requirements:
    
    * Background video should autoplay.
    * Muted.
    * Loop infinitely.
    * Plays inline on mobile.
    * Cover the entire hero.
    * No controls visible.
    * Dark overlay (approximately 55–65%) above the video so text remains readable.
    
    Include a fallback image setting.
    
    Everything should be editable inside the Theme Editor.
    
    ---
    
    ## Floating Glass Icons
    
    Create four floating decorative image elements.
    
    I will upload the PNG images.
    
    Theme Editor image settings:
    
    * Floating Icon 1
    * Floating Icon 2
    * Floating Icon 3
    * Floating Icon 4
    
    Desktop positions:
    
    Top Left
    
    Bottom Left
    
    Top Right
    
    Bottom Right
    
    Animation requirements:
    
    * Slow floating motion
    * Gentle up and down movement
    * Slight rotation
    * Different animation duration for each icon
    * Infinite animation
    * Smooth easing
    * Hardware accelerated
    * Never overlap the main content
    
    Hover effect:
    
    * Slight scale up
    * Soft glow
    * Smooth transition
    
    Mobile:
    
    * Reduce icon size by around 45%.
    * Position closer to the edges.
    * Never cover text or buttons.
    * If needed, slightly fade icons using lower opacity.
    
    ---
    
    ## Hero Content
    
    Centered.
    
    ### Heading
    
    Editable Rich Text
    
    Large bold heading.
    
    Example:
    
    High-Converting
    Ecommerce **Experiences**
    
    Highlight the last word with the theme accent color.
    
    Desktop:
    
    Approximately 56–64px
    
    Mobile:
    
    34–40px
    
    Maximum two lines.
    
    ---
    
    ### Description
    
    Editable Rich Text.
    
    Maximum width around 650px.
    
    Center aligned.
    
    Use lighter text color.
    
    Approximately 18–20px desktop.
    
    16px mobile.
    
    ---
    
    ## Buttons
    
    Two CTA buttons.
    
    Editable text.
    
    Editable links.
    
    ### Primary Button
    
    Filled button.
    
    Rounded pill shape.
    
    Large padding.
    
    Hover:
    
    * Slight lift
    * Gradient animation
    * Shadow
    
    ### Secondary Button
    
    Transparent background.
    
    Thin border.
    
    Rounded pill.
    
    Play icon on the left.
    
    Hover:
    
    * Filled background
    * Border transition
    * Slight lift
    
    Desktop:
    
    Buttons side by side.
    
    Mobile:
    
    Stack vertically.
    
    Full width.
    
    Spacing 16px.
    
    ---
    
    ## Typography
    
    Premium modern typography.
    
    Heading:
    
    Extra bold.
    
    Description:
    
    Medium weight.
    
    Letter spacing should feel premium.
    
    Balanced line height.
    
    ---
    
    ## Animations
    
    On page load:
    
    * Heading fades upward.
    * Description fades upward after heading.
    * Buttons fade upward after description.
    * Floating icons animate independently.
    * Background video loads immediately.
    
    Animations should be subtle and premium.
    
    Avoid excessive movement.
    
    ---
    
    ## Spacing
    
    Desktop:
    
    Large vertical spacing.
    
    Buttons approximately 36px below description.
    
    Tablet:
    
    Reduce spacing proportionally.
    
    Mobile:
    
    Comfortable spacing without excessive empty areas.
    
    ---
    
    ## Responsive Behaviour
    
    Desktop
    
    * Four floating icons visible.
    * Large centered heading.
    * Buttons side by side.
    * Full video background.
    
    Tablet
    
    * Icons slightly smaller.
    * Heading scales down.
    * Content remains centered.
    
    Mobile
    
    * Icons reduced in size.
    * Content perfectly centered.
    * Buttons stacked.
    * Video still covers full background.
    * No horizontal scrolling.
    * Touch-friendly spacing.
    
    ---
    
    ## Theme Editor Settings
    
    Provide editable settings for:
    
    * Background Video
    * Fallback Image
    * Heading
    * Description
    * Primary Button Text
    * Primary Button Link
    * Secondary Button Text
    * Secondary Button Link
    * Floating Icon 1 Image
    * Floating Icon 2 Image
    * Floating Icon 3 Image
    * Floating Icon 4 Image
    * Overlay Opacity
    * Hero Height
    * Enable/Disable Floating Animation
    * Enable/Disable Video
    * Accent Color
    * Text Color
    
    ---
    
    ## Performance Requirements
    
    * Lazy load decorative images.
    * Optimize animations using CSS transforms only.
    * Avoid heavy JavaScript.
    * Maintain excellent Lighthouse performance.
    * Use responsive image sizes.
    * Keep LCP optimized despite the background video.
    * Ensure accessibility with proper ARIA labels and keyboard navigation.
    
    ---
    
    ## Overall Design Style
    
    The final hero should feel like a premium Shopify Plus agency website with:
    
    * Minimal luxury aesthetic
    * Glass-style floating decorative elements
    * Cinematic background video
    * Strong visual hierarchy
    * Smooth premium animations
    * Clean spacing
    * Excellent mobile experience
    * Fully editable through the Shopify Ho
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: {{ block.settings.hero_height_desktop }}px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #000000;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-background-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-video-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    min-width: 100%;
    min-height: 100%;
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-fallback-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.overlay_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }});
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    max-width: 720px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
  }

  .ai-video-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    animation: ai-video-hero-fade-up-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.8s ease-out 0.2s forwards;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} strong {
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
  }

  .ai-video-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 auto 36px;
    max-width: 650px;
    opacity: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    animation: ai-video-hero-fade-up-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.8s ease-out 0.4s forwards;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    animation: ai-video-hero-fade-up-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.8s ease-out 0.6s forwards;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-button-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 16px 40px;
    background: {{ block.settings.primary_button_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.primary_button_text_color }};
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .ai-video-hero-button-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.primary_button_bg }} 0%, {{ block.settings.accent_color }} 100%);
  }

  .ai-video-hero-button-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 16px 40px;
    background: transparent;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    border: 2px solid {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-button-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    color: #000000;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .ai-video-hero-play-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
    pointer-events: auto;
    transition: all 0.4s ease;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3));
  }

  .ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: scale(1.1);
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4));
  }

  .ai-video-hero-icon-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    top: 10%;
    left: 8%;
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    animation: ai-video-hero-float-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} 6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-icon-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    bottom: 15%;
    left: 12%;
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size | times: 0.85 }}px;
    animation: ai-video-hero-float-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} 7s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-icon-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    top: 15%;
    right: 10%;
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    animation: ai-video-hero-float-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} 8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .ai-video-hero-icon-4-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    bottom: 12%;
    right: 8%;
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size | times: 0.95 }}px;
    animation: ai-video-hero-float-4-{{ ai_gen_id }} 7.5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes ai-video-hero-fade-up-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  {% if block.settings.enable_floating_animation %}
    @keyframes ai-video-hero-float-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateY(-20px) rotate(5deg);
      }
    }

    @keyframes ai-video-hero-float-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateY(-25px) rotate(-5deg);
      }
    }

    @keyframes ai-video-hero-float-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateY(-18px) rotate(3deg);
      }
    }

    @keyframes ai-video-hero-float-4-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateY(-22px) rotate(-4deg);
      }
    }
  {% endif %}

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-height: {{ block.settings.hero_height_tablet }}px;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_desktop | times: 0.75 }}px;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size_desktop | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-icon-1-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-video-hero-icon-2-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-video-hero-icon-3-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-video-hero-icon-4-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.icon_size | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 80px 20px;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size_mobile }}px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-button-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-video-hero-button-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 100%;
      padding: 14px 32px;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-icon-1-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-video-hero-icon-2-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-video-hero-icon-3-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-video-hero-icon-4-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.icon_size | times: 0.55 }}px;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-icon-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      top: 8%;
      left: 5%;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-icon-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      bottom: 12%;
      left: 5%;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-icon-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      top: 12%;
      right: 5%;
    }

    .ai-video-hero-icon-4-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      bottom: 8%;
      right: 5%;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<premium-video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-video-hero-background-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.enable_video and block.settings.background_video %}
      <video
        class="ai-video-hero-video-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        autoplay
        muted
        loop
        playsinline
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <source src="{{ block.settings.background_video }}" type="video/mp4">
      </video>
    {% elsif block.settings.fallback_image %}
      <img
        src="{{ block.settings.fallback_image | image_url: width: 2000 }}"
        alt="{{ block.settings.fallback_image.alt | escape }}"
        class="ai-video-hero-fallback-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        loading="eager"
        width="{{ block.settings.fallback_image.width }}"
        height="{{ block.settings.fallback_image.height }}"
      >
    {% else %}
      <div class="ai-video-hero-fallback-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);"></div>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="ai-video-hero-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
  </div>

  {% if block.settings.floating_icon_1 %}
    <div class="ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-video-hero-icon-1-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <img
        src="{{ block.settings.floating_icon_1 | image_url: width: 200 }}"
        alt="{{ block.settings.floating_icon_1.alt | escape }}"
        loading="lazy"
        width="200"
        height="200"
      >
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if block.settings.floating_icon_2 %}
    <div class="ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-video-hero-icon-2-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <img
        src="{{ block.settings.floating_icon_2 | image_url: width: 200 }}"
        alt="{{ block.settings.floating_icon_2.alt | escape }}"
        loading="lazy"
        width="200"
        height="200"
      >
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if block.settings.floating_icon_3 %}
    <div class="ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-video-hero-icon-3-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <img
        src="{{ block.settings.floating_icon_3 | image_url: width: 200 }}"
        alt="{{ block.settings.floating_icon_3.alt | escape }}"
        loading="lazy"
        width="200"
        height="200"
      >
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if block.settings.floating_icon_4 %}
    <div class="ai-video-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-video-hero-icon-4-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <img
        src="{{ block.settings.floating_icon_4 | image_url: width: 200 }}"
        alt="{{ block.settings.floating_icon_4.alt | escape }}"
        loading="lazy"
        width="200"
        height="200"
      >
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="ai-video-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h1 class="ai-video-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ block.settings.heading }}
      </h1>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
      <div class="ai-video-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ block.settings.description }}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-video-hero-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.primary_button_label != blank %}
        <a
          href="{{ block.settings.primary_button_link }}"
          class="ai-video-hero-button-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
          {{ block.settings.primary_button_label }}
        </a>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.secondary_button_label != blank %}
        <a
          href="{{ block.settings.secondary_button_link }}"
          class="ai-video-hero-button-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
          <svg class="ai-video-hero-play-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"></polygon>
          </svg>
          {{ block.settings.secondary_button_label }}
        </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</premium-video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class PremiumVideoHero{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.video = this.querySelector('.ai-video-hero-video-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        if (this.video) {
          this.video.play().catch(() => {});
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('premium-video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}', PremiumVideoHero{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

